      "behavior": "Stage actual media playback/system timeout1..600/default15. Cancel/hidden/retired callbacks leave saved policy unchanged; Apply/reopen persists and normalizes imported raw bounds without clobbering independent fields or a newer implicit-normalization target. Native saved value wins over retained ClientOptions; real legacy importer decodes the value. FileImporter installs weak Store policy into MediaTools/Ffmpeg, reaching real imports/downloader imports/maintenance and thumbnail regeneration. Paste image! uses configured tools, including ffmpeg-only image formats. The common weak reader also reaches Review MIME detection, StoreContent duplicate comparison/auto-resolution decodes, parser fetched-file detection and import-folder sidecar samples, preserving old standalone no-Store APIs. About version now uses same timed process path and preserves existing scheduling/absent UI. Capture deadline once before subprocess spawn; later Apply affects next process only. Three-second adapter preserves recorded polling outcomes while explicit fixed timeout and stream ownership remain intact. Existing bounded backend kills/waits before returning.",
